{"id": "1543777986652799147", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "769372452580229131", "author_name": "kinbote.", "content": "teams generally look reasonable in terms of characters and wods. For your lemurian team you probably want to run dreams on gmurphy and goliath in murphy's spot. Without goliaths exalt buff will be a struggle to get big damage.\n\nIf  you haven't given it a try, 24 got reworked and her mono chaos form rouse now gives stacking final damage buffs to her exalt whenever you use a posse. 24/doll/ogier with 24 posse is now kind of a reasonable team into w3 or straight to boss waves. tawil can also work pretty well in that team, you want a lot of keyflare. Ramona with exalt to get sakura reveries is also pretty good, though ramona is more contested these days between mouchette and glotan also wanting her.", "timestamp": "2026-08-31T00:22:34.026000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["116944399031730182"], "reactions": [{"emoji": "🔥", "emoji_id": null, "count": 1}], "reply_to": "1543775249974431748"}
